# Direct requirements of the Windows agent's pytest suites (agents/wnx/tests:
# regression and integration) where they run on real Windows: the harness
# Python of their QEMU tiers, :python_test_cab. Not shipped to customers.
#
# Keep this list unpinned: the resolved windows-test-cab-requirements.txt is the
# pin, regenerated with
# `bazel run //agents/modules/windows:windows_test_cab_requirements`. It is
# resolved with //:requirements.txt as constraints, so packages the repo lock
# has stay at its versions (the ones the suites are type-checked against).

pytest
pyyaml
pywin32  # win32evtlog (test_section_eventlog.py)
# pip_offline installs the closure with the pinned pip from its own wheel.
pip
